{"c":[{"id":"c5904169704ec79b","sum":"LFS (.gitattributes; lfs install; deploy lfs:true). STL raw.githubusercontent.com; photos media.githubusercontent.com; img/ only. PGJ19 cap IEC 60061-1-2014 230-232; socket 60061-2-2017 197-199; H8 GOST R 41.37-99 p.91. standartgost.ru/g/<GOST>.pdf→files.stroyinf.ru; unece 403.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"2a020576d04e892c","sum":"Images are Git LFS (.gitattributes; git lfs install; deploy checkout lfs:true). Cults createCreation takes public fileUrls and imageUrls: tag STLs from raw.githubusercontent.com, listing photos from media.githubusercontent.com.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261014T203950Z-eff7ad9401960c55","text":"Git LFS: .gitattributes for image extensions; git lfs install; Cults deploy workflow checkout lfs:true.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261014T213851Z-ae04b5b824e9273d","text":"Cults createCreation takes public fileUrls and imageUrls. This public repo's STL bytes are at raw.githubusercontent.com for a tag. Listing photos are Git LFS, so their URLs use media.githubusercontent.com.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"52ffa7beb384b17a","sum":"Listing photos are a model's img/ files; publish.yaml has no second image list. PGJ19 cap: GOST IEC 60061-1-2014 pp.230-232; socket: 60061-2-2017 pp.197-199; H8 outline: GOST R 41.37-99 p.91. standartgost.ru/g/<GOST>.pdf goes to files.stroyinf.ru; unece.org 403s curl.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261014T221030Z-54515ff6a680ce0d","text":"Listing photos are the files in a model's img/ directory. publish.yaml images is not a second copy of that folder.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261014T222523Z-e2e9f94954b895fe","text":"Standards PDFs with drawings: standartgost.ru/g/<GOST>.pdf redirects to files.stroyinf.ru (curl works). PGJ19 (H8/H9/H11 cap) is GOST IEC 60061-1-2014 pp.230-232, its socket GOST IEC 60061-2-2017 pp.197-199. unece.org 403s curl; GOST R 41.37-99 p.91 has the H8 outline.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3f99ebeae258c554","sum":"Photo commit is docs (squash uses the PR title; PR 5). summem start is silent on success. Manual Cults deploy: Run workflow from main with the tag; the tag's workflow is the old publisher. Cloudflare 1010 bans Python-urllib, which urllib adds only when User-Agent is absent.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5d8b1ecf1cb814b3","sum":"Photo commit is docs, on purpose, so each touched model gets a patch. Do not retitle it chore: squash-merge uses the PR title (PR 5). summem start prints nothing on success.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261014T234325Z-e518d920c8d024cd","text":"Photo commit is docs: add the listing photos on purpose, so both models get a patch. Do not retitle it chore. PR 5 title is docs because squash-merge uses the title.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261014T234953Z-bb4b30c459bcd561","text":"Add-a-model checklist (AGENTS.md) omits two things the existing models have: a one-paragraph AGENTS.md in the model dir and a row in the root README table. summem start prints nothing on success.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8a99568c23832ec8","sum":"Manual Cults deploy: Run workflow from main with the tag input; the tag's workflow is the old publisher. Cloudflare 1010 bans Python-urllib. urllib adds that agent only when User-Agent is absent.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T152556Z-fb44e9caeb21c926","text":"Manual Cults deploy must be Run workflow from main with the tag input. The tag's own workflow is the old publisher. Cloudflare 1010 bans the Python-urllib user agent.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T153626Z-85599dbb6e39046d","text":"A Cults user-agent test must require the header. urllib adds Python-urllib only when User-Agent is absent, so scanning the headers you set stays green.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
